{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, move to it, check properties, then do something or grab it. list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = DoSomethingWithObject    /> <SubTree ID = MobileRobotTask    />\"",
    "BT": {
